=== DESIGN ===
Router package skeleton: types.go (Destination + Entry), routing.yaml (empty),
routing_loader.go (//go:embed + hand-rolled minimal YAML parser + validateEntries),
router.go (Writer iface + Router + ErrNoRoute + tesla_router_writer_failures_total).
Hand-rolled YAML parser used to avoid pulling gopkg.in/yaml.v3 into go.mod
(gate restricts changes to internal/tesla/router/ only). Grammar locked to
the 4 entry keys (field/dest/column/also_signal_log) the prompt declares.
